    "body": "Assuming that the top layer is a fait accompli, and that it’s a goal to avoid more z-index wars in the top layer, then a new feature that specifically accommodates persistent popovers over the top layer might be the best approach.\n\n@lukewarlow [in the Matrix room](https://matrixlogs.bakkot.com/WHATWG/2025-04-07#L30):\n\n> I suspect we'd maybe be better trying to directly solve the specific use cases rather than ripping open the layer for all to access. Like perhaps we need a toast primitive that is always on top.\n\nSee also:\n* #9936\n* #10811 \n* #10708",
