    "updated_at": "2025-07-29T13:35:21Z",
    "body": "I have another related use-case, which is that I need accessibility controls (or, more precisely, the `position: fixed` button that opens the accessibility controls) to still be available even if there's a modal dialog open. It's unfortunate that I'm having to implement layer management, juggling inertness, etc in JS instead of being able to use native platform features due to this constraint.",
