    "created_at": "2026-01-12T15:01:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-12T15:01:59Z",
    "body": "I think the predominant use case for this is toasts and the issues relating to those come down to Dialogs and inertness. \n\nAdding a \"new top layer\" or equivalent seems like a solution that might create a whole set of new problems, so I don't think we should head in that direction.\n\nBy and large I consider this a dupe of #10811 which itself is a dupe of #9936. However some may disagree as the issue isn't _exactly_ that, so I'll leave it to @lucacasonato to close if you consider this to sufficiently overlap those issues?",
