    "body": "this seems like it'd be relevant to web extensions that injects a persistent element as well, does it not?\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proton Pass' passkey authentication popup</summary>\n\nProton Pass injects a `<protonpass-root-xxxx>` element to the DOM and this is where autofills get surfaced\n\n<img width=\"1277\" height=\"1436\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e42cd4a8-b627-4edf-9cbc-ac6bbb3df012\" />\n\n</details>",
